  "details": "If you then immediately go to \"Members\" and try edit yourself even though you don't have permissions (why is the edit button visible on myself?) the website explodes.\n\nYou can reproduce by:\n\n1. Leave 000000.0000\n\n2. Go to vrc.group/000000.0000\n\n3. Join\n\n4. Go to Members and click Edit on yourself\n\nIt is confirmed to work on other public groups as well.\n\nThe website will either crash with \"TypeError: C is undefined\" or \"TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'find')\".",
